WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.349
Ɓiɗɗo o ummii nder kawtal maɓɓe.

00:00:02.429 --> 00:00:09.181
E nder siftorgal kawtal ngal watti e inna mum haa ɗon, ɓe noddi ɗum Ouédraogo,  taƴorgal .

00:00:09.261 --> 00:00:16.469
Nde o mawni, o nastini laamu Mo'aaji arande nder Tenkodogo, nden kam diga maako Mo'a'i'en ngari.
